Trail tiles land here, generated by `trailprep` and never committed.

    cargo run --release -p trailprep -- \
        --name "Alpes françaises" --out data/trails/alps \
        --bbox 43.95,5.35,46.45,7.75 <extract>.osm.pbf

then assemble the manifest:

    { printf '{"regions":['; cat data/trails/*/region.json | paste -sd,; printf ']}'; } \
        > data/trails/regions.json

`trunk build` copies this whole directory into `dist/trails/`.
